universal gravitation:
\[
F = G\frac{m_1 m_2}{r^2}.
\]
This was the first demonstration that a single mathematical structure could
govern phenomena across scales.

\subsubsection{Maxwellian Electrodynamics}
Maxwell unified electricity, magnetism, and light through the field equations:
\[
\nabla \cdot \mathbf{E} = \rho,\qquad
\nabla \times \mathbf{B} = \mu_0\mathbf{J} + \mu_0\epsilon_0\frac{\partial \mathbf{E}}{\partial t}.
