\subsubsection{Einsteinian Relativity}
Einstein unified spacetime geometry and gravitation through:
\[
G_{\mu\nu} = \frac{8\pi G}{c^4}T_{\mu\nu}.
\]
This introduced geometric invariance as the foundation of physical law.

